diff --git a/changelog/70150.added.md b/changelog/70150.added.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..d414f88
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog/70150.added.md
@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@
+Added support for ``min`` usage thresholds to the ``diskusage`` beacon, so a mount
+can alert when its usage drops unexpectedly low (typically a sign the filesystem
+failed to mount) in addition to the existing high-usage alerting.
